  "package_readmes": {
    "src/arm_console/README.md": "PyQt5 arm/gripper console using ROS topics and services. Serial ownership remains in the driver packages. See the root docs/architecture.md, docs/bringup.md and docs/safety.md.",
    "src/wrist_camera_bringup/README.md": "RealSense D405 launch composition, health diagnostics and a bounded camera smoke test. Configure your device serial explicitly. Camera health does not validate hand-eye calibration or arm safety. See the root docs/vision.md and docs/calibration.md.",
    "src/dual_camera_foundation/README.md": "Dual-camera perception, timestamped transforms, hand-eye calibration tools and guarded experimental arm workflows. The publication excludes site calibration and the robot model. See the root docs/vision.md, docs/calibration.md and docs/safety.md.",
    "src/tabletop_grasp/README.md": "RGB-D tabletop geometry and planning software. The publication excludes the robot/CAD model and site calibration, so full MoveIt/gripper-model demonstrations require separately authorized assets. See the root docs/vision.md and models/README.md."
  },
